    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The 6th Armored Division (\"Super Sixth\") was an armored division of the United States Army during World War II. It was formed with a cadre from the 2nd Armored Division. 6th AD was formed under the 1942 Table of Organization and Equipment.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999960893621,
